# Broadside Bombardiers is cast on turn 5 off three Mountains and attacks (haste). With only itself and lands to
# sacrifice, the boast is not offered: the cost is "another creature or artifact", and a land is neither. After combat
# Mox Ruby (mana value 0) is cast, which is the positive control: the same boast is now offered, sacrifices the Mox
# for 2 + 0 damage, and Bot2 has taken 2 from combat and 2 from the boast.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Broadside Bombardiers
Mox Ruby
Mountain x4
Mountain x6

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
